        <activityName xml:lang="en">Basalt, at mine</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Basalt, at mine
The module is designed for the use as raw-material for rockwool.;
UUID: 9790811b-f1ed-329e-9252-1beb31c9d17e
The module includes a mining step and a subsequent benefication step comprising crushing, washing and classification.
Location: Data for one german quarry used as proxy for whole European situation
Technology: Basalt is exploited in open-pit quarries.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9790811b-f1ed-329e-9252-1beb31c9d17e.xml</text>
